book python_nfkc_own v1
description "A transfer in fullwidth letters that NFKC makes balance, the attribute of the Python client's Book that reads the balances"

unit pcs

account stock(sku: string) : pcs
  at least 0 refused as out_of_stock
account suppliers : pcs outside
account customers : pcs outside

transfer ｂａｌａｎｃｅ(delivery: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key delivery, sku
  move qty from suppliers to stock(sku)

transfer ship(order: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key order, sku
  move qty from stock(sku) to customers
